<title>USA: Union Pacific spinoff to join S&amp;P 500.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific spinoff to join S&amp;P 500.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it will add Union Pacific Resources Group Inc to the S&amp;P 500 Index after the close of trading on October 15, 1996.</p>
<p>Union Pacific Corp is spinning off its 83 percent stake in Union Pacific Resources to its shareholders on that date.</p>
<p>Community Psychiatric Centers will be removed from the S&amp;P 500, Standard &amp; Poor's said.</p>
<p>Also, Standard &amp; Poor's said it will replace Waterhouse Investor Services Inc in the SmallCap 600 Index with Logicon Inc after the close of trading on October 15, 1996.</p>
</text>
